l restart when needed, clean stale metadata, and show loading/live/reconnecting/stale/failed plus last successful update.","rationale":"Observability must expose its own health and freshness.","userImpact":"No unexplained blank dashboard.","maintainerImpact":"Lifecycle and activation become explicit contracts.","effort":"medium","workScale":"normal","planningDepth":"standard","routeTarget":"planning","routeKind":"advance","routeRationale":"Crosses lifecycle, protocol, browser, tests, and docs.","directImplementationScope":{"acceptance":[],"acceptanceCriteria":[],"componentRefs":[],"pathScopes":[],"verification":[]},"affectedLayers":[],"risk":"medium","approvalAuthority":"","recommendation":"approve","recommendationRationale":"Observed repeated failure requires hardening.","agentAssessment":{"stance":"aligned","userAlignment":"Explicitly approved.","projectBenefit":"Trustworthy observability base.","rationale":"Fix lifecycle before richer telemetry.","concerns":[]},"changeType":"task","targetRefs":[],"expectedBehavior":"Healthy sessions return populated verified endpoints; unhealthy sessions return exact remediation, never false success.","regressionPlan":"Real Pi process and browser tests cover startup, endpoint, reload, mismatch, restart, shutdown, cleanup, loading, loss, recovery, and failure.","safetyBoundary":"Loopback dashboard serving lifecycle, token capability, pinned-runtime identity, and read-only API availability.","failureModes":["dead endpoint returned as success","stale loaded package after /reload","stale endpoint metadata","server handle leak","browser transport loss without visible recovery"],"negativeTestPlan":"Prove dead ports, stale tokens, mismatched loaded identity, failed restart, disconnected SSE, unavailable state, and shutdown all fail visibly and safely.","compatibilityImpact":"Existing Sprints Queue, Trace Detail, URL capability, and read-only APIs remain; only unhealthy starts change from false-success URL to actionable failure.","nonGoals":[],"preservedInvariants":[]},{"id":"CHG-implementation-worker-observability","question":"CHG-implementation-worker-observability","decisionKind":"improve","decisionType":"improve","currentState":"One trace-level Implementation Loop owns aggregate quality, but users cannot understand each worker's Task execution or how parallel results converge.","currentStateRefs":[".codewiki/kb/system/components/loop-model.md",".codewiki/kb/system/components/implementation-loop.md",".codewiki/kb/system/components/runtime.md","src/dashboard/state.ts","src/dashboard/assets.ts","src/runtime/host-runner.ts","src/implementation/loop.ts","tests/runtime/pi-extension.test.mjs"],"desiredState":"Keep one Implementation Loop per Sprint Trace. Show workers as Task Assignment attempts with local evidence; retain trace-level authority for coverage, conflicts, aggregate acceptance, quality, and merged proof. Extend only Implementation Trace Detail with worker lanes and Integration and Exit Review.","rationale":"Concurrent execution needs visibility without multiple semantic authorities.","userImpact":"Users understand worker progress and aggregate blockers.","maintainerImpact":"Clear worker attempt projection.","effort":"high","workScale":"large","planningDepth":"standard","routeTarget":"planning","routeKind":"advance","routeRationale":"Coordinates runtime, projection, UI, tests, and docs.","directImplementationScope":{"acceptance":[],"acceptanceCriteria":[],"componentRefs":[],"pathScopes":[],"verification":[]},"affectedLayers":[],"risk":"medium","approvalAuthority":"","recommendation":"approve","recommendationRationale":"User approved architecture.","agentAssessment":{"stance":"aligned","userAlignment":"Explicitly approved.","projectBenefit":"Makes Implementation observable.","rationale":"Separate execution from semantic closure.","concerns":[]},"changeType":"task","targetRefs":[],"expectedBehavior":"Worker attempts converge visibly into aggregate review; direct work renders without fake workers.","regressionPlan":"Cover worker lifecycle, retries, conflicts, partial collection, direct implementation, and every aggregate exit status.","failureModes":[],"currentPain":"Current detail cannot explain worker Task, activity, checks, acceptance coverage, paths, blocker, lease, retry, or convergence.","desiredOutcome":"Users can follow every worker attempt and aggregate validation while one Implementation Loop remains authoritative.","successSignal":"Fixture and browser coverage proves direct and worker implementations across queued/running/stale/blocked/failed/completed/retried/conflicting and aggregate exit states.","nonGoals":["no new semantic loop","no sub-traces","no worker authority to close Implementation","no redesign outside Implementation Trace Detail"],"preservedInvariants":[]},{"id":"CHG-worker-observation-signal-boundary","question":"CHG-worker-observation-signal-boundary","decisionKind":"harden","decisionType":"harden","currentState":"Durable worker lifecycle is too sparse for live activity, while copying raw prompts, reasoning, tools, and logs into traces would be unsafe and noisy.","currentStateRefs":[".codewiki/kb/system/components/runtime.md",".codewiki/kb/system/components/implementation-loop.md","src/runtime/host-runner.ts","src/dashboard/state.ts","src/dashboard/server.ts"],"desiredState":"Use durable meaningful milestones plus labeled ephemeral phase, sanitized activity, observed time, lease freshness, and bounded progress. Ephemeral data may disappear and cannot satisfy quality.","rationale":"Hybrid signals provide honest liveness without new truth.","userImpact":"Useful live worker status without private internals.","maintainerImpact":"Narrow telemetry seam.","effort":"medium","workScale":"normal","planningDepth":"standard","routeTarget":"planning","routeKind":"advance","routeRationale":"Needs schema, instrumentation, freshness, redaction, and tests.","directImplementationScope":{"acceptance":[],"acceptanceCriteria":[],"componentRefs":[],"pathScopes":[],"verification":[]},"affectedLayers":[],"risk":"medium","approvalAuthority":"","recommendation":"approve","recommendationRationale":"User selected hybrid model.","agentAssessment":{"stance":"aligned","userAlignment":"Explicitly approved.","projectBenefit":"Balances insight and integrity.","rationale":"Telemetry complements traces.","concerns":[]},"changeType":"task","targetRefs":[],"expectedBehavior":"Live activity degrades honestly to stale/last-known while durable history remains.","regressionPlan":"Test allowlists, bounds, redaction, expiry, restart, fallback, and authority isolation.","safetyBoundary":"Boundary between append-only semantic trace truth and non-authoritative ephemeral runtime observation.","failureModes":["ephemeral telemetry treated as completion evidence","private reasoning or prompts exposed","secrets or source contents leaked","unbounded telemetry growth","stale telemetry shown as live"],"negativeTestPlan":"Reject forbidden fields and oversized payloads; expire stale observations; prove restart loss, durable fallback, no trace append, and no effect on quality exit.","compatibilityImpact":"Existing trace schemas remain authoritative; consumers without telemetry retain durable worker state and existing views.","nonGoals":[],"preservedInvariants":[]},{"id":"CHG-human-readable-activity-feed","question":"CHG-human-readable-activity-feed","decisionKind":"improve","decisionType":"improve","currentState":"Dry event vocabulary forces users to understand internal ids and schemas to know what happened and what comes next.","currentStateRefs":[".codewiki/kb/system/components/terminal-ui.md","src/dashboard/state.ts","src/dashboard/assets.ts","tests/runtime/pi-extension.test.mjs"],"desiredState":"Build deterministic source-backed narration where meaningful items identify work/actor, action, outcome, impact, next action, timestamp, freshness, and evidence. Resolve friendly labels and coalesce noise without speculation.","rationale":"Trace truth is optimized for replay, not comprehension.","userImpact":"Pipeline understandable without schema knowledge.","maintainerImpact":"Central narration contract.","effort":"medium","workScale":"normal","planningDepth":"standard","routeTarget":"planning","routeKind":"advance","routeRationale":"Needs fact model, templates, projection, UI, and tests.","directImplementationScope":{"acceptance":[],"acceptanceCriteria":[],"componentRefs":[],"pathScopes":[],"verification":[]},"affectedLayers":[],"risk":"low","approvalAuthority":"","recommendation":"approve","recommendationRationale":"User explicitly requested and approved narrative feed.","agentAssessment":{"stance":"aligned","userAlignment":"Explicitly approved.","projectBenefit":"Legible trace-backed progress.","rationale":"Deterministic narration prevents drift.","concerns":[]},"changeType":"task","targetRefs":[],"expectedBehavior":"Meaningful feed items stay concise, contextual, evidence-linked, and trustworthy.","regressionPlan":"Golden fixtures test enrichment, labels, coalescing, missing context, freshness, blockers, route-back, and completion.","failureModes":[],"currentPain":"Raw claim and evidence event names do not explain progress, significance, blockers, or next action.","desiredOutcome":"At all times the feed explains what happened, why it matters, and what comes next in plain operational language.","successSignal":"Golden narratives cover all loops, worker states, checks, blockers, route-backs, aggregation, stale/live states, and missing context without unsupported claims.","nonGoals":["no model-generated speculation","no new workflow truth","no raw logs in Activity Feed","no fabricated percentage or timing precision"],"preservedInvariants":[]},{"id":"CHG-bounded-developer-log","question":"CHG-bounded-developer-log","decisionKind":"harden","decisionType":"harden","currentState":"Narrative feed hides execution noise, but maintainers lack a correlated record of externally observable actions. Semantic traces are unsuitable for raw diagnostics.","currentStateRefs":[".codewiki/kb/system/components/runtime.md",".codewiki/kb/system/components/terminal-ui.md",".codewiki/kb/system/components/loop-contracts.md","src/runtime/host-runner.ts","src/dashboard/server.ts","src/dashboard/state.ts","src/dashboard/assets.ts"],"desiredState":"Add Dev Log capturing permitted worker/session, turn, tool, file-path, command, check, quality, runtime, retry/error, trace-operation, collection, and integration actions with correlation, timing, status, sanitized bounded summaries, refs, and redaction metadata. Store under runtime temp while active/blocked/failed; stream live; restrict permissions; clean after successful closure; grant zero semantic authority.","rationale":"Separate bounded diagnostics gives developers depth without polluting traces or normal feed.","userImpact":"Normal feed stays clear while developer diagnosis is precise.","maintainerImpact":"Adds diagnostic schema, sink, retention, and security duties.","effort":"high","workScale":"large","planningDepth":"standard","routeTarget":"planning","routeKind":"advance","routeRationale":"Security-sensitive cross-cutting implementation requires staged tasks.","directImplementationScope":{"acceptance":[],"acceptanceCriteria":[],"componentRefs":[],"pathScopes":[],"verification":[]},"affectedLayers":[],"risk":"medium","approvalAuthority":"","recommendation":"approve","recommendationRationale":"User approved bounded Dev Log with explicit safety limits.","agentAssessment":{"stance":"aligned","userAlignment":"Explicitly approved.","projectBenefit":"Deep debugging without trace bloat.","rationale":"Redaction and bounded retention make telemetry acceptable.","concerns":[]},"changeType":"task","targetRefs":[],"expectedBehavior":"Developers inspect every permitted observable action during active or failed work; successful closure retains semantic evidence and deletes raw diagnostics.","regressionPlan":"Test event ordering/coverage, correlation, permi